# Aetherion (Drident)

AI-native decision workspace for regulated pension advisory firms. Swedish occupational pension is the starting market.

## Architecture

Monolithic FastAPI backend + Next.js 14 frontend. PostgreSQL + pgvector. Multi-tenant (org-scoped).

## Key Services

- `reasoner.py` — Two-pass LLM: tool_use (structured output) + Citations API (verified evidence)
- `suitability.py`, `pension_calculator.py`, `eligibility.py` — Deterministic calculations (code, not LLM)
- `memory.py` — RAG: embedding, chunking, semantic search
- `control.py` — Compliance checks
- `document.py` — IDD-compliant doc generation (DOCX/PDF)

## Domain Terminology

Use consistently: `case` (not ticket), `recommendation` (not suggestion), `evidence` (not reference), `audit_entry` (not log), `knowledge_item` (not document), `client_organization` (employer company), `organization` (advisory firm/tenant), `meeting_brief` (not prep).
